      <p class="cs-para">Over seven months, the account went from 20+ campaigns with no structural separation to a three-tier architecture — Brand Defense, Core Shopping, and Performance Max — each with defined query ownership and no cross-campaign competition for the same demand. The feed rewrite changed which queries the products were eligible for, and impression share on high-intent searches moved within the first week.</p>
